# Supabase — optional. Without these, the app runs in guest mode with no
# accounts or sync, exactly as before. Get both from your Supabase project's
# API settings. The publishable key is safe to expose in the browser (row-level
# security protects the data); set real values in .env.local (gitignored) and in
# your host's environment variables, never in the repo.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
